create.ui.machine_guide.title=Machine Guide

## Machine Guide UI
create.ui.machine_guide.spout.description=HOW IT WORKS\nThe Spout receives fluid through pipes and pours it onto the item below. It uses 1 bucket of fluid per process and transforms the item when a recipe exists.\n\nHOW TO USE\n1. Connect a Mechanical Pump and Fluid Pipes to the Spout.\n2. Send water, lava, honey, chocolate or milk into it.\n3. Place the item on a Depot or Basin below the nozzle.\n4. When the fluid pours, the item becomes the recipe output.

create.ui.machine_guide.spout.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nPours piped fluid onto an item to process it.

create.ui.machine_guide.spout.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nConnect a pump and pipes, then place the item below the nozzle.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_arm.description=The Mechanical Arm moves items between depots, belts, funnels and other inventories. Use it to automate item pickup and delivery.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_arm.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nMoves items automatically between marked locations.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_arm.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nMark an input and output, then supply rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.vault.description=The Item Vault stores many items in one large container. Connect more Vault blocks together to increase its storage size.
create.ui.machine_guide.vault.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nStores many items; connected Vaults share one inventory.
create.ui.machine_guide.vault.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nConnect funnels, belts or machines to its sides.
create.ui.machine_guide.brass_funnel.description=The Brass Funnel moves items into or out of inventories and can filter what passes through it.
create.ui.machine_guide.brass_funnel.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nInserts or extracts filtered items.
create.ui.machine_guide.brass_funnel.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nAttach it to an inventory or belt and set a filter.
create.ui.machine_guide.brass_tunnel.description=The Brass Tunnel moves items across belts and can split or filter item flow between connected belts.
create.ui.machine_guide.brass_tunnel.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nRoutes and distributes items between belts.
create.ui.machine_guide.brass_tunnel.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPlace it on a belt and add filters when needed.
create.ui.machine_guide.crushing_wheel.description=The Crushing Wheel crushes items into smaller materials. It is used for processing ores, stones and other items.
create.ui.machine_guide.crushing_wheel.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nCrushes ores, stones and other items into materials.
create.ui.machine_guide.crushing_wheel.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPower both wheels and feed items between them.
create.ui.machine_guide.encased_fan.description=The Encased Fan pushes air and can process items with nearby blocks like water, lava or fire.
create.ui.machine_guide.encased_fan.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nUses airflow with water, lava or fire to process items.
create.ui.machine_guide.encased_fan.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPower the fan and place items in its airflow.
create.ui.machine_guide.millstone.description=The Millstone grinds items into powders or smaller materials using rotation power.
create.ui.machine_guide.millstone.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nGrinds items into powders and smaller materials.
create.ui.machine_guide.millstone.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nSupply rotation and insert items from the top.
create.ui.machine_guide.chute.description=The Chute moves items vertically between inventories, belts and machines.
create.ui.machine_guide.chute.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nMoves items vertically between blocks.
create.ui.machine_guide.chute.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPlace it above or below an inventory or machine.
create.ui.machine_guide.deployer.description=The Deployer uses held items on blocks or items in front of it, like a player action.
create.ui.machine_guide.deployer.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nUses held items like a player interacting with a target.
create.ui.machine_guide.deployer.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nGive it an item, a target and rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.drain.description=The Item Drain removes fluid from filled items and sends the fluid into pipes or tanks.
create.ui.machine_guide.drain.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nRemoves fluid from items into pipes or tanks.
create.ui.machine_guide.drain.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nConnect fluid storage and place a filled item on top.
create.ui.machine_guide.drill.description=The Mechanical Drill breaks blocks in front of it when powered by rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.drill.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nBreaks blocks directly in front of it.
create.ui.machine_guide.drill.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPoint it at a block and supply rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_crafter.description=The Mechanical Crafter crafts recipes automatically and can connect with other crafters for larger patterns.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_crafter.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nAutomatically crafts recipes using connected crafters.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_crafter.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nArrange the recipe, add ingredients and supply rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_pump.description=The Mechanical Pump moves fluids through Fluid Pipes when powered by rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_pump.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nMoves fluids through connected pipes.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_pump.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nConnect pipes and supply rotation in the desired direction.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_saw.description=The Mechanical Saw cuts blocks and can process logs or wood items using rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_saw.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nCuts blocks, logs and wooden items.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_saw.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPoint it at the target and supply rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.smart_chute.description=The Smart Chute moves items vertically like a Chute, but can filter which items pass through.
create.ui.machine_guide.smart_chute.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nMoves only filtered items vertically.
create.ui.machine_guide.smart_chute.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPlace it by an inventory and set its filter.
create.ui.machine_guide.smart_fluid_pipe.description=The Smart Fluid Pipe controls fluid flow and can filter which fluid is allowed through.
create.ui.machine_guide.smart_fluid_pipe.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nAllows only the selected fluid through a pipe.
create.ui.machine_guide.smart_fluid_pipe.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nConnect it to the pipe line and set a fluid filter.
create.ui.machine_guide.harvester.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nHarvests crops in front of a moving contraption.
create.ui.machine_guide.harvester.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nAttach it facing outward and move the contraption through crops.
create.ui.machine_guide.portable_storage_interface.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nTransfers items between a moving contraption and stationary storage.
create.ui.machine_guide.portable_storage_interface.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPlace two interfaces facing each other within range.
create.ui.machine_guide.weighted_ejector.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nLaunches deposited items toward a chosen landing point.
create.ui.machine_guide.weighted_ejector.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nSet its target, then feed items onto the plate.
create.ui.machine_guide.hose_pulley.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nDrains or fills fluid sources through a lowered hose.
create.ui.machine_guide.hose_pulley.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nLower the hose into fluid and connect fluid pipes.
create.ui.machine_guide.sequenced_gearshift.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nRuns a programmed sequence of rotations.
create.ui.machine_guide.sequenced_gearshift.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nConfigure its steps and activate it with redstone.
create.ui.machine_guide.windmill_bearing.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nTurns attached sails and blocks into a wind-powered contraption.
create.ui.machine_guide.windmill_bearing.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nAttach sails, then activate the bearing.
create.ui.machine_guide.sticker.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nPushes or pulls glued blocks when powered by redstone.
create.ui.machine_guide.sticker.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nPlace it facing the structure and send a redstone signal.
create.ui.machine_guide.cart_assembler.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nAttaches a block structure to a minecart.
create.ui.machine_guide.cart_assembler.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nBuild above it, place a cart on the rail and power it.
create.ui.machine_guide.redstone_link.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nSends or receives wireless redstone on a matching frequency.
create.ui.machine_guide.redstone_link.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nSet matching frequency items on both links.
create.ui.machine_guide.fluid_tank.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nStores fluids; connected tanks share capacity.
create.ui.machine_guide.fluid_tank.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nConnect pumps and pipes to fill or drain it.
create.ui.machine_guide.steam_engine.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nConverts heated boiler pressure into rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.steam_engine.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nSupply a tank with water and heat, then attach the engine.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_bearing.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nRotates an attached block structure as a contraption.
create.ui.machine_guide.mechanical_bearing.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nAttach the structure and supply rotation.
create.ui.machine_guide.super_glue.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nJoins blocks so they move together in a contraption.
create.ui.machine_guide.super_glue.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\nHold and drag across the faces you want to connect.
create.ui.machine_guide.mixer.description=The Mechanical Mixer mixes items and fluids in a Basin to create new recipes.
create.ui.machine_guide.mixer.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nThe Mechanical Mixer works above a Basin. It mixes ingredients, fluids or heated recipes when the setup is correct.
create.ui.machine_guide.mixer.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\n1. Place a Basin below the Mixer.\n2. Add the recipe ingredients.\n3. Give the Mixer rotation power.\n4. Add heat when the recipe needs it.
create.ui.machine_guide.press.description=The Mechanical Press presses items on a Depot or Basin to make shaped outputs.
create.ui.machine_guide.press.description.page1=HOW IT WORKS\n\nThe Mechanical Press pushes down on items placed below it. It can press items on a Depot or work with a Basin recipe.
create.ui.machine_guide.press.description.page2=HOW TO USE\n\n1. Place a Depot or Basin below the Press.\n2. Put the input item there.\n3. Give the Press rotation power.\n4. Collect the pressed output.
